  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon garlic salt",
    "1 cup water",
    "1 large egg",
    "2 cups oil for frying, or as needed",
    "1 pound button mushrooms, quartered"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iDFyCnblEJT9l5jSZvgz_Scaet4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/144950-deep-fried-mushrooms-ddmfs-step-01-3dcc25c2ead6442892e411170b736b32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/144950/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir flour and garlic salt together in a medium bowl. Mix in water and egg until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5t8ua_sls0B_HGomsOPsqTRGIBE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/144950-deep-fried-mushrooms-ddmfs-step-02-44ef69422b1644da8bc8e5ddf17b36ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/144950/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large deep skillet over medium-high heat until a drop of batter will sizzle and float to the top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2MXAbfA-mX7OM3CUKLDgurtjycA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/144950-deep-fried-mushrooms-ddmfs-step-03-932ee082894b45899ea93833bafeceab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/144950/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in small batches, dip mushrooms into batter and fry in hot oil until golden brown, 3 to 5 minutes. Remove with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
